{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 3",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-634563992261558802 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=634563992177607186&sectionId=634563992261558802)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVJCKVElZv_text","label":"ggVJCKVElZv_text","default":"<p>Photographs are particularly powerful because they already contain a personal story. A picture can bring someone back to a specific place, celebration, friendship, or period of their life. This makes photographs a natural starting point for a meaningful personalized gift.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>With Memobrick, a favorite photograph can be transformed into a brick mosaic that the recipient can build themselves. Instead of receiving another item that is immediately ready to use, they get an experience that allows them to gradually recreate an image that already means something to them.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJxD-kvgRf_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggJxD-kvgRf_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/518ace4e-7951-4780-afa7-4f362235d122.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJxD-kvgRf_alt","label":"ggJxD-kvgRf_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggJxD-kvgRf_title","label":"ggJxD-kvgRf_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggRkQLnKIYt_text","label":"ggRkQLnKIYt_text","default":"Personalization Can Turn a Gift Into an Experience"},{"type":"html","id":"ggiLQVfYRmR_text","label":"ggiLQVfYRmR_text","default":"<p>Another benefit of a personalized gift is that it can create an experience around the moment of giving. Memobrick is a good example because the recipient does not simply receive a finished piece of artwork. They can spend time assembling the mosaic, watching the photograph gradually appear, and eventually deciding where to display it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The process can also be shared with other people. Families can build a favorite family photograph together, couples can work on a picture from a memorable trip, and friends can turn a funny photograph into a project they can enjoy together. The finished Memobrick becomes a reminder not only of the original photograph but also of the time spent creating it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggScsjPgIwB_text","label":"ggScsjPgIwB_text","default":"A Personalized Gift Can Fit Almost Any Occasion"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxQ5eD-wRB_text","label":"ggxQ5eD-wRB_text","default":"<p>Personalized gifts are not limited to one particular celebration. They can work for birthdays, Christmas, anniversaries, weddings, graduations, Mother's Day, Father's Day, housewarmings, or simply as an unexpected surprise. The occasion may change, but the idea remains the same: choose something that has a connection to the person receiving it.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For someone who loves their family, a family photograph can become a meaningful keepsake. For a pet lover, a favorite picture of their companion can become something they proudly display. For someone who enjoys traveling, a photograph from an unforgettable adventure can bring that experience back into their everyday life. The flexibility is what makes personalized gifts so useful when you want to give something that feels genuinely individual.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggxeiqe5JXC_text","label":"ggxeiqe5JXC_text","default":"Why Memobrick Makes the Gift More Personal"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNayJEy8IM_text","label":"ggNayJEy8IM_text","default":"<p>Memobrick takes personalization a step further by allowing the recipient to become part of the creation process. The photograph they receive is not simply printed and placed inside a box. It becomes a mosaic that they can assemble piece by piece, turning the gift into an activity as well as a keepsake.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We also believe that personalization should involve human care. Technology can assist us during the creative process, but the result is reviewed and refined by people. We look for mistakes, make adjustments when needed, and pay attention to the details that help transform a customer's photograph into a Memobrick they will be proud to display.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggMo0K-y6ID_text","label":"ggMo0K-y6ID_text","default":"<p>When selecting a photograph, do not worry too much about finding an image that looks like it belongs in a professional photoshoot. A meaningful photograph can be a candid family picture, a funny moment with friends, a childhood photograph, a favorite pet, or a snapshot from a trip.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>The most important question is simple: <strong>Does this photograph mean something to the person receiving it?</strong> If it brings back a story, makes them smile, or reminds them of someone they love, you may already have the right starting point.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For photographs with several people, vehicles, pets, or many small details, choosing a larger Memobrick can help give those elements more room. For cars and motorcycles, sizes such as <strong>30x20 or 40x30</strong> are recommended when you want more space for recognizable details.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggd7_dpjCSx_text","label":"ggd7_dpjCSx_text","default":"The Gift Does Not Have to Be Expensive to Be Meaningful"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrhnF7C1Cj_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggrhnF7C1Cj_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0375/0107/5595/files/07bab032-5483-436e-b569-c296d6646df0.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrhnF7C1Cj_alt","label":"ggrhnF7C1Cj_alt","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"ggrhnF7C1Cj_title","label":"ggrhnF7C1Cj_title","default":"Memobrick Photo Mosaic Gift Idea"},{"type":"html","id":"gg01T1Rumxo_text","label":"gg01T1Rumxo_text","default":"<p>A thoughtful gift is not necessarily determined by its price. Sometimes, the most appreciated gifts are the ones that demonstrate that you know the person well.</p><p>A personalized gift gives you the opportunity to show that thought without needing to choose something extravagant. The value comes from the connection between the gift and the recipient.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>That is why a photograph from an ordinary day can sometimes mean more than an expensive item that has no personal connection.</p>"}],
    "blocks": [{"type": "@app"}],
    "locales": {}
  }
